ext-black leading-tight">6 Alasan Pasien Kami<br/>Pulih Lebih Cepat</h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-14"><div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-gray-400 hover:shadow-md transition-all"><span class="text-3xl block mb-3">📅</span><h3 class="font-bold text-black mb-2">Reservasi Tanpa Antri</h3><p class="text-sm text-black leading-relaxed">Cukup WhatsApp, pilih jadwal, datang sesuai jadwal, langsung ditangani! Tidak ada waktu yang terbuang untuk menunggu.</p></div><div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-gray-400 hover:shadow-md transition-all"><span class="text-3xl block mb-3">🎯</span><h3 class="font-bold text-black mb-2">1 Fisioterapis, 1 Pasien</h3><p class="text-sm text-black leading-relaxed">Penanganan yang benar-benar personal. Fisioterapis kami fokus 100% menemukan dan mengatasi masalahmu — bukan membagi perhatian ke banyak pasien sekaligus.</p></div><div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-gray-400 hover:shadow-md transition-all"><span class="text-3xl block mb-3">🔍</span><h3 class="font-bold text-black mb-2">Pemeriksaan Detail & Transparan</h3><p class="text-sm text-black leading-relaxed">Kami jelaskan secara detail dan transparan apa masalahmu, apa penyebabnya, dan apa opsi penanganan terbaik. Kamu berhak tahu.</p></div><div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-gray-400 hover:shadow-md transition-all"><span class="text-3xl block mb-3">💪</span><h3 class="font-bold text-black mb-2">Metode Fisioterapi Modern</h3><p class="text-sm text-black leading-relaxed">Kombinasi elektro terapi, manual terapi, dan terapi latihan. Mengobati tanpa obat — dengan gerakan yang tepat dan terarah.</p></div><div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-gray-400 hover:shadow-md transition-all"><span class="text-3xl block mb-3">🎓</span><h3 class="font-bold text-black mb-2">Fisioterapis Berpengalaman</h3><p class="text-sm text-black leading-relaxed">Seluruh tim kami adalah lulusan terbaik yang melalui proses seleksi dan pengembangan keahlian yang ketat sebelum menangani pasien.</p></div><div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:border-gray-400 hover:shadow-md transition-all"><span class="text-3xl block mb-3">🏥</span><h3 class="font-bold text-black mb-2">Layanan Fisioterapi Lengkap</h3><p class="text-sm text-black leading-relaxed">Dari cedera olahraga, pasca operasi, cedera otot & sendi, hingga gangguan saraf — semua ditangani dalam satu klinik.</p></div></div><hr class="border-gray-200 mb-14"/><!-- ALAT --><div class="bg-gray-900 text-black rounded-2xl p-10 mb-14"><span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-black block mb-3">Teknologi & Peralatan</span><h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-black mb-6 leading-tight">Alat Fisioterapi Terkini<br/>untuk Pemulihan Optimal</h2><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3"><div class="border border-gray-700 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 text-sm text-black flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-black">▸</span> Extracorporeal Shockwave Therapy (ESWT)\n        </div><div class="border border-gray-700 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 text-sm text-black flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-black">▸</span> Ultrasound Therapy (US)\n        </div><div class="border border-gray-700 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 text-sm text-black flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-black">▸</span> Neuromuscular Electrical Stimulation (NMES)\n        </div><div class="border border-gray-700 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 text-sm text-black flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-black">▸</span> Dry Needling\n        </div><div class="border border-gray-700 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 text-sm text-black flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-black">▸</span> Gym & Alat Latihan Lengkap\n        </div><div class="border border-gray-700 rounded-lg px-4 py-3 text-sm text-black flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-black">▸</span> Manual Terapi\n        </div></div></div><!-- LAYANAN --><div class="mb-3"><span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-black block mb-2">Spesialisasi Kami</span><h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-black mb-6">Kondisi yang Kami Tangani</h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-14"><div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-xl px-5 py-3.5 flex items-center gap-3 text-sm font-semibold text-black"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"></span>Cedera Olahraga\n      </div><div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-xl px-5 py-3.5 flex items-center gap-3 text-sm font-semibold text-black"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"></span>Pemulihan Pasca Operasi\n      </div><div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-xl px-5 py-3.5 flex items-center gap-3 text-sm font-semibold text-black"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"></span>Cedera Otot & Sendi\n      </div><div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-xl px-5 py-3.5 flex items-center gap-3 text-sm font-semibold text-black"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"></span>Gangguan Saraf\n      </div><div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-xl px-5 py-3.5 flex items-center gap-3 text-sm font-semibold text-black"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"></span>Nyeri Punggung & Leher\n      </div><div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-xl px-5 py-3.5 flex items-center gap-3 text-sm font-semibold text-black"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-gray-400 flex-shrink-0"></span>Rehabilitasi Atlet\n      </div></div><hr class="border-gray-200 mb-14"/><!-- KOMITMEN --><div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-8 mb-14"><span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-black block mb-2">Komitmen Kami</span><h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-black leading-tight mb-6">Yang Kamu Rasakan<br/>Setiap Kunjungan</h2><ul class="divide-y divide-gray-200"><li class=