1"/></svg></div><span class="text-black text-sm leading-relaxed">Tujuan akhir kami bukan kamu terus datang ke klinik — tapi kamu pulih total dan bisa kembali beraktivitas dalam kondisi terbaikmu!</span></li></ul></div><!-- LOKASI --><div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-8 flex items-start gap-5 mb-14 flex-wrap"><span class="text-4xl">📍</span><div><h3 class="text-xl font-black text-black mb-1">Praktek Fisioterapi Gang Sehat</h3><p class="text-sm font-semibold text-black">Jl. Kesehatan Gg. Kesehatan Dalam No. 4, Pontianak</p><p class="text-xs text-black mt-2">Reservasi & info lebih lanjut tersedia via WhatsApp</p></div></div><!-- CTA --><div class="bg-gray-900 text-black rounded-2xl p-12 text-center"><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black leading-tight mb-4">\n        Siap Mulai Perjalanan<br/>Pemulihanmu?\n      </h2><p class="text-black text-base max-w-sm mx-auto mb-8">\n        Reservasi sekarang — pilih jadwal yang cocok, datang, dan langsung ditangani. Semudah itu.\n      </p><a href="https://wa.me/6281346111417" class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 bg-white text-black font-bold text-sm px-8 py-4 rounded-xl hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-xl transition-all"><svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#25D366" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.298-.497.099-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.5-.669-.51-.173-.008-.371-.01-.57-.01-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372-.272.297-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 0 1.462 1.065 2.875 1.213 3.074.149.198 2.096 3.2 5.077 4.487.709.306 1.262.489 1.694.625.712.227 1.36.195 1.871.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.694.248-1.289.173-1.413-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347m-5.421 7.403h-.004a9.87 9.87 0 01-5.031-1.37